{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778377055136,"sessionID":"ses_1f07835ceffeU0BzoW0ufLYq3r","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_OmV1PrmsMLNJArXMR4SaNEiK","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/src/ontology/cl-edit.owl","offset":35315,"limit":35},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/src/ontology/cl-edit.owl</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n35315: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072103 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\n35316: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_4072103 \"2025-11-05T11:49:53Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35317: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38016881\") oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym obo:CL_4072103 \"dermal sheath cup cell\")\n35318: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25465495\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4072103 \"hfDSC\")\n35319: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072103 \"hair follicle dermal stem cell\")\n35320: EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4072103 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000134 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002073)))\n35321: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072103 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0042634))\n35322: \n35323: # Class: obo:CL_4072104 (fibrochondrocyte)\n35324: \n35325: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:28939894\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:31871141\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34608249\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072104 \"A chondrocyte with hybrid fibroblastic-chondrogenic characteristics found in fibrocartilage, particularly in the avascular inner zone and transitional middle zone of the meniscus. In humans, fibrochondrocytes are marked by predominant expression of type I collagen (COL1A1) and fibril-associated collagens (COL3A1, COL6A1), while retaining type II collagen (COL2A1) expression and exhibiting lower SOX9 than hyaline chondrocytes. This molecular profile underlies the synthesis of abundant type I collagen essential for fibrocartilage matrix and reflects an intermediate phenotype between fibroblast and chondrocyte.\")\n35326: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072104 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\n35327: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34608249\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4072104 \"fibrocartilage chondrocyte\")\n35328: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:28939894\") oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym obo:CL_4072104 \"meniscus fibrochondrocyte\")\n35329: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:31871141\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4072104 \"FC\")\n35330: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072104 \"fibrochondrocyte\")\n35331: EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4072104 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000138 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0001995)))\n35332: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072104 obo:CL_0002320)\n35333: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072104 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000003264))\n35334: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072104 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000003328))\n35335: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072104 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002292 obo:PR_000003353))\n35336: \n35337: # Class: obo:CL_7770002 (juxtacanalicular tissue cell)\n35338: \n35339: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25356439\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32341164\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:39829808\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_7770002 \"A trabecular meshwork cell of the juxtacanalicular tissue (JCT), characterized by a spindle-shaped, fibroblast-like morphology within a loose extracellular matrix immediately adjacent to Schlemm's canal. It expresses CHI3L1 (human and mouse) and ANGPTL7 (human), as well as smooth muscle actin for contractility. Unlike other trabecular meshwork cells, it does not form monolayers but exists in a loose network, regulating aqueous humor outflow resistance through continuous ECM remodelling, mechanotransduction, and formation of intracellular pores historically called giant vacuoles.\")\n35340: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_7770002 \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3275\")\n35341: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_7770002 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\n35342: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_7770002 \"2025-01-29T08:52:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35343: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32341164\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_7770002 \"JCT cell\")\n35344: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_7770002 \"juxtacanalicular tissue cell\")\n35345: SubClassOf(obo:CL_7770002 obo:CL_0000327)\n35346: SubClassOf(obo:CL_7770002 obo:CL_0002367)\n35347: SubClassOf(obo:CL_7770002 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0070278))\n35348: \n35349: # Class: obo:CL_7770003 (beam A cell)\n\n(Showing lines 35315-35349 of 35467. Use offset=35350 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072103 <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_4072103 \"2025-11-05T11:49:53Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38016881\") oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym obo:CL_4072103 \"dermal sheath cup cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25465495\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4072103 \"hfDSC\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072103 \"hair follicle dermal stem cell\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4072103 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000134 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002073)))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4072103 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0042634))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4072104 (fibrochondrocyte)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOw